"AND WHEN BOTH THE SUBTYPE AND THE SUPERTYPE BEAR A MACHINE, THE ANSWER IS THE SUBTYPE'S (2026-09-21, task #122 item 16). sr1 is filed only as a Support Request; the cone read makes it a hit under Request too, because Support Request is a subtype of Request and both declare a State Machine Definition. StateMachineDefinitionIsForObjectType lists Request before Support Request here on purpose, so a reading that still took the first hit in that row's order would answer Request, and this case would catch it; ui:mt_pick answers Support Request regardless of the row order, because it is the lower of the two in the subtype chain.",
