"A MARKED RULE MARKS ITS HEAD (2026-10-03). A head whose reading carries no marker takes the mode its marked rules give it, as a marked reading gives it: Layer depends on Layer, marked `*` on both its rules, is fully derived and leaves the assertable schema, and Layer rests on Layer, marked `+`, is semi-derived and stays in it. The head is the fact type the rule`s words name less their subscripts and literal values, so `* Loader has Resumability `checkpoint` iff ...` marks Loader has Resumability. A reading`s own marker stands: Domain reaches Domain, read `+`, stays semi-derived under a rule marked `*`. And the readings` rows of a head its rule owns stay inert, as under a marked reading: Layer b depends on Layer a is no row of Layer depends on Layer, whose rule alone fills it.",
DEF("case:a-marked-rule-marks-its-head", S2(S3(A("COMP"), A("solve:assoc"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("state:derived")), S3(A("COMP"), A("read:schema_of"), A("compile:text_rows")))), S2(A("layer.md"), A("Layer(.Name) is an entity type.\nLayer provides service to Layer.\nLayer depends on Layer.\nLayer rests on Layer.\n\n* Layer1 depends on Layer2 iff Layer2 provides service to Layer1.\n\n* Layer1 depends on Layer3 iff Layer1 depends on Layer2 and Layer2 depends on Layer3.\n\n+ Layer1 rests on Layer2 iff Layer2 provides service to Layer1.\n")))),
DEF("case:a-head-its-rule-marks-fully-derived-is-not-assertable", S2(S3(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), N(1)), S3(A("COMP"), A("solve:assoc"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("state:declared")), S3(A("COMP"), A("read:schema_of"), A("compile:text_rows"))))), S2(A("layer.md"), A("Layer(.Name) is an entity type.\nLayer provides service to Layer.\nLayer depends on Layer.\nLayer rests on Layer.\n\n* Layer1 depends on Layer2 iff Layer2 provides service to Layer1.\n\n* Layer1 depends on Layer3 iff Layer1 depends on Layer2 and Layer2 depends on Layer3.\n\n+ Layer1 rests on Layer2 iff Layer2 provides service to Layer1.\n")))),
DEF("case:a-rule-marks-the-fact-type-its-words-name", S2(S3(A("COMP"), A("solve:assoc"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("state:derived")), S3(A("COMP"), A("read:schema_of"), A("compile:text_rows")))), S2(A("loader.md"), A("Loader(.name) is an entity type.\nResumability is a value type.\n  The possible values of Resumability are 'checkpoint', 'none'.\nLoader has Resumability.\nLoader records a cursor.\n\n* Loader has Resumability 'checkpoint' iff Loader records a cursor.\n")))),
DEF("case:a-readings-marker-stands-over-its-rules", S2(S3(A("COMP"), A("solve:assoc"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("state:derived")), S3(A("COMP"), A("read:schema_of"), A("compile:text_rows")))), S2(A("domain.md"), A("Domain(.Name) is an entity type.\nDomain is contained in Domain.\nDomain reaches Domain. +\n\n* Domain1 reaches Domain2 iff Domain1 is contained in Domain2.\n")))),
DEF("case:a-row-under-a-head-its-rule-owns-is-inert", S2(S4(A("COMP"), N(5), A("theta:find_desc"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("LayerDependsOnLayer")), S3(A("COMP"), A("solve:assoc"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("state:fts")), S3(A("COMP"), A("read:schema_of"), A("compile:text_rows")))))), S2(A("layer.md"), A("Layer(.Name) is an entity type.\nLayer depends on Layer.\n\n* Layer1 depends on Layer3 iff Layer1 depends on Layer2 and Layer2 depends on Layer3.\n\nLayer 'b' depends on Layer 'a'.\n")))),
"A WRITE ASKS WHO IS WRITING (2026-10-03; Sam: a write`s operation is the event, else the fact type, and every transport passes a login). The notes store of fixture:noted-store, with the app designating `User is authorized` and sam its one user, and the four write verbs` answer, outcome-and-store, in the store: a fact POST by the empty caller is asked to sign in (401) and one by bob, whom the app does not authorize, is forbidden (403), each answering in two parts, with no store; sam`s commits. An entity POST, a PUT, a fact DELETE and an entity DELETE ask the empty caller to sign in too, and so does assert, a write verb of the MCP, answering F as a verb does. A read is not asked. The same store with no designation takes a fact POST from the empty caller, and the gate passes its assert: an app with no auth context -- claude, tasks -- is gated nowhere.",
