"AND THE INSTANCE A FACT INTRODUCES IS VALIDATED WITH IT (2026-09-09). Agent has a mandatory phone; the store below is clean -- ann has hers -- and TeamHasAgent names a new agent, cal, who has none. The fact is refused on the spot, because the trial store that Thm 1 validates already holds cal as an Agent (a role population is a subset of its player's), and the refusal answers the store it was given: cal is not an instance afterwards. Before this the fillers were registered only on the committed store, so the same fact committed clean, and the NEXT write of any kind found cal's unfilled phone and was refused -- a state no single write could leave. The positive twin names ann, who has a phone, and commits.",
