"AND AT EVERY STEP OF A WALK (2026-10-02). Six writes over the same fixture, asserts and retractions mixed -- a lapse that a report clears and a retraction restores, a layer withdrawn and then engaged -- and after each one every rule head the store holds must be exactly what derive:closed computes from nothing over that store. This is what keeps the incremental closure honest: it is a shortcut only while it answers what the fixpoint answers.",
