"AN ASSERT OVER A CLEAN STORE ANSWERS WHAT THE WHOLE CHECK ANSWERS (2026-10-03). main:ab_viols runs the uniqueness and mandatory constraints a write touched when the store before it is known clean. The same assert is answered over a store flagged clean and over the same store unflagged, which takes the whole check: over fixture:neg-deo-store with a page that raises the prohibition on NegL; over that store holding the violation already, NegL l1 standing, with a page naming l1; and over fixture:neg-store with a page that breaks NegG`s uniqueness, which is refused. <same, same, same, the second answer`s body, the third answer`s status>.",
