"THE ENGINE SAYS A RECIPE AS ONE SELECT OVER WHERE ITS SOURCES ARE STORED (2026-10-02). A place is <table, columns in role order, flag column or #, layout>, and every select names its columns c1 to cn: a projection is DISTINCT over the source`s, a difference an EXCEPT, a join the left row`s second column equal to the right row`s first, the joined row the left row and the right row`s tail, as theta:natjoin builds it. A recipe of another form is no select.",
