"AND A HEAD IS THE ENGINE`S ONLY WHEN THE CLOSURE NEEDS NONE OF IT (2026-10-02). The closure no longer holds the population of a head the engine computes, so a head some other rule reads is left to the closure, and so is a head that reads itself through another: the engine computes a head after every head it reads, and a cycle has no first. A rule is <head, recipe>.",
