"AN ENTITY TABLE IS WRITTEN A CHUNK OF ITS KEYS AT A TIME (2026-10-02), and every key is in exactly one chunk: a list is cut into chunks of the size asked, the last as long as is left, and keys said as the same text stay in one row, in their order, as rmap:key_rows gathers them.",
