"AN INSTANCE FILLS EVERY ROLE OF ITS READING, OR IT IS REJECTED (2026-10-02). readings/ui/design.md declared `Theme is the default Theme.`, the ring ThemeIsTheDefaultTheme over two Themes, and its instance quoted one value: the reader put a one-value row beside the two-value one and said nothing, and a module booted from the carriers died `selector 2 out of range 1` on every write. The one-value sentence is a REJECTED finding and no row now, and the two-value sentence still lands.",
