"A RULE IS JOINED ON EVERY SUBSCRIPTED VARIABLE ITS LEGS SHARE (2026-10-03). The I Ching proposal`s trigram reversal is `Trigram1 is the reversal of Trigram2 iff Trigram1 has bottom- Polarity1 and Trigram1 has middle- Polarity2 and Trigram1 has top- Polarity3 and Trigram2 has bottom- Polarity3 and Trigram2 has middle- Polarity2 and Trigram2 has top- Polarity1`. The general join folds Trigram1`s three legs as its star, and Trigram2`s bottom leg joins them on Polarity3. Trigram2`s middle and top legs each share Trigram2 and a polarity with the chain, and each was joined on the polarity alone, so `some trigram has middle- Polarity2` stood where the rule says `Trigram2 has middle- Polarity2`. The rule answered the 32 pairs whose second trigram`s bottom line is the first`s top line, where 8 are reversals. fixture:text-derived reads a file as a check reads it and answers one head`s rows over the facts the file asserts: <head, <file name, text>>.",
